60,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Given the slippage risk and the fund terms, Wetland Restoration seems the only viable option.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,The drainage data supports reshaping the water flow. Wetland Restoration addresses the root cause.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,The volunteers are already doing habitat work. This plan fits their skills and the reduced staff.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Minako,,"It is risky, but the basin proved water works can last. We must enforce the aftercare contract.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The fund covers the capital. The high upkeep is a known quantity, not a surprise.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Minako, are you comfortable with the tree mortality risk if we go with wetlands?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"The crossing counts show people avoid soft margins, but boardwalks can guide them safely.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,I am happy to support the volunteers in this new setup.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, wetlands are different from avenue plantings. The reeds are hardier. I am comfortable.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,I have no objections. The financial model holds.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I vote for Wetland Restoration.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I vote for Wetland Restoration.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,I vote for Wetland Restoration.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Minako,,I vote for Wetland Restoration.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I vote for Wetland Restoration.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Kenji,,It seems we are all in agreement.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,The data points to a single logical conclusion.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minato,,I am glad we found a plan that works for everyone.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Minako,,Let us ensure the contract is tight this time.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will prepare the long-term cost projections.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
